# Sends: an acid jam built from the panel, 8 bars.
wait 300
# 909: kick on the quarters, closed hat on the off-beats, clap on 2 and 4
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tapkey b7
tapkey w2
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
tapkey w14
tapkey b6
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
# 303 A and B: TB-3PO lines
turn ALGO 2
tap ARP
tap OCT+
turn ALGO 1
tap ARP
tap OCT+
# sends: MIX's PARTS, a part picked with its black key: knob 3 its reverb, knob 4 its delay
tap LFO
tapkey b0
turn K3 25
tapkey b2
turn K4 -10
tapkey b3
turn K4 30
shot 21_sends_303.png
# the delay's TAPE (FX, the DELAY page, knob 4): tape already (the factory's), a touch more worn
tap FX
tap FX
turn K4 1
shot 22_tape.png
expect sound5.2.2 70
# tempo 135, play 8 bars
press HOME
turn SELECT 10
release HOME
expect tempo 135
wav jam.wav
tap PLAY
wait 14300
tap HOME
wait 200
shot 23_home_jam.png
tap PLAY
wait 1500
wavstop
expect peak_db_min -30
